{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y多次把钢琴声写成“歌声”，而且部分感受句较长，个别瞬间不如X的短词轻巧。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把关键心理转折放大加亮，扫一眼就能抓住每段发生了什么、为什么退缩或改变；感受紧跟对应的话，部分还随音乐出现，不必像X那样在两列之间寻找关系。Y的水波、呼吸、停顿、声音变化也更容易形成具体的身体感受，并且从最初不敢表露到最后不再隐藏，有一条能跟下来的情绪线。X的短词偶尔更轻盈，但大量感受同时堆在右侧，听着音乐扫过去容易只留下零散氛围，而抓不住它们与人物变化的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2f53fdec-7f17-47d8-8eb8-27cec673b012", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T032328249322Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.782, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:24:02.028495+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f265a43abd06b34d65018982c87d6666b2e48a58449d741b393045d457b0d1f2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen